"动作过程中应能正常呼吸并说出简短句子。如果必须憋气才能推回，请更靠近墙面站立或减少次数。" = "You should be able to breathe normally and say short sentences during the movement. If you must hold your breath to push back, stand closer to the wall or do fewer reps.";
